{"about_the_game":"The story follows Mariko, a seventeen year old who is on the cusp of graduating high school. <br />\r\nShe is the lone passenger of a slowly dying train station. As a practical young adult, she doesn\u2019t see why her family couldn\u2019t have just moved closer to the high school she is attending. She is rather embarrassed by the whole situation and the attention it garners her. She just wants to graduate and go to a university in the big city. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, life in the sticks isn\u2019t all that it seems. While riding the train home, Mariko ends up at an unexpected stop, which changes her life forever.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"4766998dc2d6d1b3e8d63195bb7a0b19e224c76d.jpg","localized_name":"Kamikakushi","name":"Kamikakushi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/563520/4766998dc2d6d1b3e8d63195bb7a0b19e224c76d.jpg"},{"icon":"338c86c0683816a868b0977993aefc9e79883baf.jpg","localized_name":"Kitsune","name":"Kitsune","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/563520/338c86c0683816a868b0977993aefc9e79883baf.jpg"},{"icon":"684d4fb4cc9930bd74230b2ee1ebd0e708a17494.jpg","localized_name":"Jorogumo","name":"Jorogumo","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/563520/684d4fb4cc9930bd74230b2ee1ebd0e708a17494.jpg"},{"icon":"2054ac9dd2680519d7d9885b9ab27365f43eb9c2.jpg","localized_name":"Wisdom","name":"Wisdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/563520/2054ac9dd2680519d7d9885b9ab27365f43eb9c2.jpg"},{"icon":"c0ed8a1a55658bd5159b3044d34bafc3f67b99b8.jpg","localized_name":"Benevolence","name":"Benevolence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/563520/c0ed8a1a55658bd5159b3044d34bafc3f67b99b8.jpg"},{"icon":"a1d5c3ed85e613ad4c0e5a82aacf1fc0ab2f841d.jpg","localized_name":"Valor","name":"Valor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pub